      "id": "experiment:benchmark-small-repos",
      "type": "Experiment",
      "label": "On small repos the graph ties with the code",
      "description": "What: 17 multi-hop questions on four small repos: code 1.00 (after a grader fix), graph 0.98, hybrid 1.00, with the same tokens and more time. The graph uses fewer calls on multi-hop questions (2 to 4 against 5 to 9), backs claims with IDs, and never invents on a stale graph.\nWhere: docs/benchmark.md; docs/report.md §On small repos\nLearned: The decisive test is a repo too large to read.",
      "attrs": {
        "created": "2026-10-15",
        "session": "session:2026-10-15-3c0f074e",
